WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.200
Before the Eclipse, Orun taught light to remember.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.400
Within the Crown Engine: every name. Every oath. Every life.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.400
Regent Serath promised mercy from pain.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.400
Then he turned memory into a throne.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.400
In the final hour, two hands redrew the road.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:48.400
The sun was not extinguished. It was taken.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.400
And a kingdom forgot that it had ever been free.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:05.200
Beneath the Veil, one cartographer remembered a sunrise.
